     "html": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;text-align:left;\"><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">Frans</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">Betekenis</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">Erna komt</th></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\"><strong>chaque</strong></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">elk, ieder</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">altijd <strong>enkelvoud</strong>: <em>chaque jour</em></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\"><strong>quelques</strong></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\"><strong>enkele</strong>, een paar</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">meervoud: <em>quelques amis</em></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\"><strong>plusieurs</strong></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">verschillende</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">meervoud: <em>plusieurs fois</em></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\"><strong>tout le</strong>, toute la</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">heel de</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">enkelvoud: <em>toute la journée</em></td></tr></table>"
    },
    {
     "soort": "tekst",
     "html": "Het vragende woord heeft vier vormen, en ze zijn alle vier juist <strong>geschreven</strong> als het geslacht en het getal kloppen: <strong>quel</strong>, <strong>quelle</strong>, <strong>quels</strong>, <strong>quelles</strong>. En <em>cette <strong>semaine</strong></em> is deze week: <em>semaine</em> is vrouwelijk, dus <em>cette</em>, terwijl <em>cet arbre</em> mannelijk is met een klinker."
    },
    {
     "soort": "tekst",
     "html": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;text-align:left;\"><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">Getal</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">In Frankrijk</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">Let op</th></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">71</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\"><strong>soixante et onze</strong></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">met <em>et</em>; bij ons septante et un</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">80</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\"><strong>quatre-vingts</strong></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">met een <strong>s</strong>, want vier maal twintig</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">81</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">quatre-vingt-un</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">hier <strong>zonder</strong> s</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">2000</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\"><strong>deux mille</strong></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\"><em>mille</em> krijgt <strong>nooit</strong> een s</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">200</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">deux cents</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\"><em>cent</em> krijgt er wél een, net als vingt</td></tr></table>"
